---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="404 - Page Not Found | Net Worth Calculator" description="The requested page could not be found. Return to Net Worth Calculator to explore wealth benchmarks by age, career, milestone, and state.">
	<meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
	
	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-center space-y-8">
		<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
			<span class="text-3xl font-black">$</span>
		</div>
		
		<header class="space-y-2">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">404 - Page Not Found</h1>
			<p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm max-w-md mx-auto">The link you followed may be outdated, mistyped, or the page has moved. You can easily benchmark your personal wealth standing using our complete Federal Reserve calculation tools and detailed financial guides below.</p>
		</header>

		<div class="pt-2">
			<a href="/" class="inline-block px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold transition-all shadow-md">
				Return to Main Net Worth Calculator
			</a>
		</div>

		<!-- Helpful Navigation Grid -->
		<section class="text-left space-y-4 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
			<h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-center">Popular Wealth Calculators & Resources</h2>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
				<a href="/average-net-worth-by-age" class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500 transition-all block">
					<strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-bold">Average Net Worth by Age (2026)</strong>
					<span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 block">Full Federal Reserve breakdown from Under 35 to 75+.</span>
				</a>
				<a href="/net-worth-percentile" class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500 transition-all block">
					<strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-bold">Net Worth Percentile Guide</strong>
					<span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 block">Discover thresholds for Top 10%, Top 5%, and Top 1%.</span>
				</a>
				<a href="/coast-fire-calculator" class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500 transition-all block">
					<strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-bold">Coast FIRE Calculator</strong>
					<span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 block">Calculate the exact portfolio balance needed to stop saving.</span>
				</a>
				<a href="/net-worth-by-state" class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500 transition-all block">
					<strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-bold">Net Worth by State (All 50 States)</strong>
					<span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 block">Compare state medians, cost of living, and tax benefits.</span>
				</a>
				<a href="/career/software-engineer" class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500 transition-all block">
					<strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-bold">Software Engineer Net Worth</strong>
					<span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 block">Tech industry salary progression, RSUs, and wealth milestones.</span>
				</a>
				<a href="/career/physician-doctor" class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500 transition-all block">
					<strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-bold">Doctor & Physician Net Worth</strong>
					<span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 block">Medical residency debt payoff and attending wealth accumulation.</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- General Wealth Benchmarks Reference Summary -->
		<section class="text-left bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 text-xs text-slate-300 space-y-3">
			<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">US Federal Reserve SCF Median Benchmarks (Quick Reference Guide)</h3>
			<p>
				According to the Federal Reserve Board Survey of Consumer Finances (SCF), median household net worth figures and top wealth benchmarks by age demographic bracket are:
			</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
				<li><strong>Under 35:</strong> $39,000 median ($340,000 threshold for top 10% high achiever standing)</li>
				<li><strong>Ages 35–44:</strong> $135,600 median ($980,000 threshold for top 10% emerging millionaire standing)</li>
				<li><strong>Ages 45–54:</strong> $247,200 median ($1,950,000 threshold for top 10% multi-millionaire standing)</li>
				<li><strong>Ages 55–64:</strong> $364,500 median ($2,800,000 threshold for top 10% affluent pre-retirement standing)</li>
				<li><strong>Ages 65–74:</strong> $409,900 median ($3,400,000 threshold for top 10% distribution stage standing)</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="text-slate-400 pt-1 leading-relaxed">
				All financial tools and interactive percentile benchmarks on GetNetWorthCalculator.com execute 100% client-side inside your browser with complete privacy and zero data logging, giving you an anonymous and accurate benchmark toward financial independence.
			</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
